### Login employer -> saves employerToken
POST http://localhost:8083/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.employer@matchhire.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("employerToken", response.body.token); %}

### Login candidate -> saves candidateToken
POST http://localhost:8083/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.candidate@matchhire.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("candidateToken", response.body.token); %}

### Wrong password -> 401
POST http://localhost:8083/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.candidate@matchhire.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}